| Test: the three H.264 clips through vcdec with its defaults (a cacheable
| Physical Memory Pool, LDM 8), as a player drives it (send until the
| input is full, take every picture ready), every picture checked against
| FFmpeg's own decode, matched by pts. Reports to Result.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.Result
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
